SOAPBOX: What better time to test a new antenna home made. I speak of EndFed,
SOAPBOX: home made, last trial to play with the radio. Decided to participate
SOAPBOX: in His Majesty the King of Spain CW, cat. extreme for me ... / QRP.
SOAPBOX: Happy to have tried, with great effort, little power, but good
SOAPBOX: signals. The antenna is about 40 meters long, half is vertical and the
SOAPBOX: rest to slooper. My location is about 200 meters above sea level, LOC.
SOAPBOX: JN66QD and mountain reflections make me hear amazing things. Very hard
SOAPBOX: to put a log / QRP, only call for some, but not problems, mine was a
SOAPBOX: search to see how many country could put in log. So, really happy ...
SOAPBOX: 100 country in all band, really satisfied, although I finished hours
SOAPBOX: before, to family commitments. Try again next year I hope this
SOAPBOX: contest, always QRP, but with antenna performance !!! See you next one
SOAPBOX: !!!  Special thanks to my good friend Al, IV3BSY, great lover of QRP
SOAPBOX: !!!  73 de IV3ZXQ / QRP dit dit
